  "description": "Exception-based error handling for ASP.NET Core 8+ with RFC 9457 ProblemDetails, structured logging, typed exceptions, automatic EF Core/Gridify/FluentImporter exception mapping, SignalR support, and flexible naming conventions. Alternative to Result pattern libraries.",
  "iconFile": "pandatech.png",
